name: {{NAME}}-deployment
description: Manual-run deployment for {{NAME}}. No schedule; each run starts a standby session.
agent: ./agent.md
environment_id: ./environment.yaml
vault_ids: []
budget: {type: limit, max_list_cost: {amount: "{{BUDGET}}", currency: USD}}
{{RESOURCES}}
initial_events:
  - type: user.message
    content:
      - type: text
        text: |
          You are on standby for the /dev-task cloud backend. Do no repository work until the coordinator sends a task with a --done check. Reply only: ready.
